<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mai (title)</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mai was the title of the kings of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kanem-bornu-empire">Kanem-Bornu</a>, held by rulers of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sayfawa-dynasty">Sayfawa dynasty</a>. The mai held sacred and political authority and governed with a council of notables and royal officials. The title reflects the long continuity of kingship in the Kanem-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bornu">Bornu Empire</a>.</p></div>
